==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
The Travel Medallion is exclusive to {{TMT}} [[Downloadable Content]] pack. It can be found inside a [[Hidden Chest]] in the chamber underneath [[Lomei Labyrinth Island]]. Its location is hinted at in ''[[Super Rumor Mill V2]]'' in [[South Akkala Stable]] as part of the "[[EX Teleportation Rumors!]]" [[Side Quest]].<ref name="BotW Super Rumor Mill V2"/> The Travel Medallion can be used to register [[Link]]'s current position as a [[Travel Gate]] on the Map. Only one location can be registered at a time.<ref name="BotW Web"/>

